<title>USA: U.S. stockpile rejects ferro-manganese bids.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile rejects ferro-manganese bids.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center rejected all bids for high carbon ferro-manganese. The bids were received on July 22.</p>
<p>The nexted sale by negotiation is August 26.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
